        <section style="padding: var(--spacing-3xl) var(--spacing-sm);">
            <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
                <div style="background: var(--color-surface); padding: var(--spacing-2xl); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);">
                    <h2 style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: var(--font-2xl); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">Our Beginning</h2>
                    <p style="font-size: var(--font-base); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md); color: var(--color-text);">
                        Grace and Praise Bangladeshi Church was founded with a vision to create a spiritual home 
                        for the Bangladeshi community in California. Our journey began with a small group of believers 
                        who gathered to worship God and celebrate their cultural heritage.
                    </p>
                    <p style="font-size: var(--font-base); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md); color: var(--color-text);">
                        Over the years, we have grown into a vibrant community that embraces both our Bangladeshi roots 
                        and our identity as followers of Christ. We continue to welcome families from all backgrounds 
                        who seek to grow in their faith and serve God together.
                    </p>
                    <p style="font-size: var(--font-base); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md); color: var(--color-text);">
                        Our church has become a beacon of hope, love, and spiritual growth in our community, 
                        hosting regular services, cultural celebrations, and outreach programs that touch lives 
                        and spread God's love.
                    </p>
                    
                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.1), rgba(212, 175, 106, 0.1)); padding: var(--spacing-lg); border-radius: var(--radius-md); margin-top: var(--spacing-lg); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-secondary);">
                        <p style="font-size: var(--font-lg); font-style: italic; color: var(--color-primary); margin: 0;">
                            "What began as a small gathering has blossomed into a thriving spiritual family, 
                            united by our passion for God and compassion for people."
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

